 *not* a block diagonal matrix since it can't be partitioned in the way described above:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}B=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -5\\end{aligned}],\\,B=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -5\\end{aligned}],\\,B=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -5\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- $C$ is a block diagonal matrix. Indeed, we can partition it as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}C=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 7 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"$C$ only.\"" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-32176/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "bf19e2ee-7c42-58b0-9254-5a44f315288a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-32176"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-42127/selection/b967c3002b3f913c5b31990d1f8159d3e1e979aa07e2842a8b67bfff1a2fd3f2" :answer/id #uuid "cec76c25-94e5-5eda-94d8-0aed6aa599dd" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$A$ and $B$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42127/selection/2377e3ffc3b5cd65e1036103e0b988e5af6634b2438c63c3b7cc0592571401ab" :answer/id #uuid "72251ae9-36c2-5712-91c7-9e8ccae655a2" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$A$ and $C$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42127/selection/685c02320dbe687345f93d820499dea4c0c82808b910e8a0e5841f77aa82209d" :answer/id #uuid "b458c643-5d20-5413-9af2-a89fd76af9aa" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$A$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42127/selection/e956c3af673c94782038951d8de50bf89c9a53bf4daf2ca6725a4bea4229074c" :answer/id #uuid "24c75603-e702-5f7a-a6f3-8b64fdd31842" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$B$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42127/selection/9ed3305a02906a861616af6ff886306c4a2a74885d99f506419451b33c7c9d2d" :answer/id #uuid "6cd31260-edb9-57b2-9574-30b7485d06f4" :an