rminants:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\begin{aligned}a & 2 & 10 \\\\ 0 & b & 12 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4\\end{aligned}| & =|\\begin{aligned}a & 2 & 10 \\\\ 0 & b & 12 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}a & 2 \\\\ 0 & b\\end{aligned}|\\cdot 4 \\\\  & =-5\\cdot 4 \\\\  & =-20.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-42129/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4b507561-8134-50ff-8c23-c4ecc546450d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-42129"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-109267/selection/0fbe558572ecce67593db00d22f0d8d9d09c98d019451cd13488790a441e6c9c" :answer/id #uuid "6f1b458c-5237-5ac8-b3aa-d819e8d20541" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "20" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109267/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "bfba3269-624b-55e6-8896-a8c0b88525b2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109267/selection/56019ff80d11d678dbd5eca83c729f420f1b6a8ad4259032846618d6b48aa0bc" :answer/id #uuid "4c3d2ca9-9333-510e-91bb-d2be35ae84e6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109267/selection/a4c8bdda186d0d425e9963bf17967cd5e356d934f319fa58135b8f8cf8a589f8" :answer/id #uuid "8b71e710-d579-5003-a825-48f18d2bd780" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "30" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109267/selection/66dedd51c696580d351ab6a45c1c63cb495081ccf219c3c3c62f1d90fbeb5a49" :answer/id #uuid "78f81c67-a31b-5726-b794-8b31f1113093" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "15" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109267/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "762aa0a5-9485-5781-972d-86bfab080831" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-109267/selection/66dedd51c696580d351ab6a45c1c63cb495081ccf219c3c3c62f1d90fbeb5a49" :answer-field/choices ["q-109267/selection/0fbe558572ecce67593db00d22f0d8d9d09c98d019451cd13488790a441e6c9c" "q-109267/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" "q-109267/selection/56019ff80d11d678dbd5eca83c729f420f1b6a8ad4259032846618d6b48aa0bc" "q-109267/selection/a4c8bdda186d0d425e9963bf17967cd5e356d934f319fa58135b8f8cf8a589f8" "q-109267/selection/66dedd51c696580d351ab6a45c1c63cb495081ccf219c3c3c62f1d90fbeb5a49"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-109267" :question/id #uuid "48d26bc3-1264-5e8a-96c1-206a84a69b6e" :question/math-academy-id "q-109267" :question/problem "Find $\\,|\\begin{aligned}v & w & 0 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 4 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 5 & 5\\end{aligned}|$ given that $\\,|\\begin{aligned}v & w \\\\ 5 & 4\\end{aligned}|=3.$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that we have a block diagonal matrix. Therefore, its determinant is equal to the product of the diagonal blocks' determinants:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\begin{aligned}v & w & 0 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 4 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 5 & 5\\end{aligned}| & =|\\begin{aligned}v & w & 0 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 4 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 5 & 5\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}v & w \\\\ 5 & 4\\end{aligned}|\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ 5 & 5\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =3\\cdot 5 \\\\  & =15.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-109267/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4b507561-8134-50ff-8c23-c4ecc546450d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-109267"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-131675/selection/ed46a7ab66f4e1f0492ab8ee0b3b7d22df7bff44011d5a9f713d6c9393035ddc" :answer/id #uuid "27875b50-84c0-5f0b-8344-a6001697ec4f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "49" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-131675/selection/e27691a27b7e3f66468d078da0545795b51b538c2c99ea1c86bd034a65b3f255" :answer/id #uuid "cb1e8579-670f-5dc3-bd65-3c0b0aac7125" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{24}{7}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-131675/selection/6aa0658ec3b64327f8a2d599faa4f715c940036c4e92b012fbfb8370208f2e7d" :answer/id #uuid "2e65d65b-b30e-5c3e-b304-cafe1cc8efe3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{7}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-131675/selection/5d022a88a643e97abec4d01dfce48411101475c0705a98f29f3a8e3560fb0616" :answer/id #uuid "c1683765-85cf-553b-a257-fec436aa66de" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-131675/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "25210cef-1df5-50b8-bb75-f3fddb7253e4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-131675/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "e78289fb-a066-5ef3-b87b-80d68538761a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-131675/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer-field/choices ["q-131675/selection/ed46a7ab66f4e1f0492ab8ee0b3b7d22df7bff44011d5a9f713d6c9393035ddc" "q-131675/selection/e27691a27b7e3f66468d078da0545795b51b538c2c99ea1c86bd034a65b3f255" "q-131675/selection/6aa0658ec3b64327f8a2d599faa4f715c940036c4e92b012fbfb8370208f2e7d" "q-131675/selection/5d022a88a643e97abec4d01dfce48411101475c0705a98f29f3a8e3560fb0616" "q-131675/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-131675" :question/id #uuid "9d4543cb-b0a6-54a1-a9b2-aa6b974ff683" :question/math-academy-id "q-131675" :question/problem "Find $\\,|\\begin{aligned}v & 5{w}^{2} & 0 & 0 \\\\ 3v & 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -8 & 5\\end{aligned}|$ given that $\\,|\\begin{aligned}v & 5{w}^{2} \\\\ 3v & 2\\end{aligned}|=\\frac{1}{7}.$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that we have a block diagonal matrix. Therefore, its determinant is equal to the product of the diagonal blocks' determinants:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\begin{aligned}v & 5{w}^{2} & 0 & 0 \\\\ 3v & 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -8 & 5\\end{aligned}| & =|\\begin{aligned}v & 5{w}^{2} & 0 & 0 \\\\ 3v & 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -8 & 5\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}v & 5{w}^{2} \\\\ 3v & 2\\end{aligned}|\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 \\\\ -8 & 5\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{7}\\cdot 7 \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-131675/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4b507561-8134-50ff-8c23-c4ecc546450d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-131675"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-109266/selection/ca566c3861ad95266b92d3d8e36c85c39daf1d1780cc1bf826ae0ac7accce583" :answer/id #uuid "bf4fb0b5-ad2d-5083-8e69-accc693881b4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "45" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109266/selection/f4ed4b34f4a5de49898377314514d2de061007c11b4d8d545eea74864f386ee8" :answer/id #uuid "0b4993ac-c29e-5063-b465-032cc20a8d7e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-90" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109266/selection/a4c8bdda186d0d425e9963bf17967cd5e356d934f319fa58135b8f8cf8a589f8" :answer/id #uuid "e4b21485-912b-5118-b9d5-f560e002558a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "30" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109266/selection/4fa830bda994f89067ddecaf273e4fa78aa4d8447b6388b70cafa0fc166e6f67" :answer/id #uuid "cd3e51d6-6d43-54c2-abd1-9ac4d52ea628" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-50" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109266/selection/ebfc0e0786b9e08f32fe2539ae50e791a60b7c4613bb2a0820cefbd3ea742454" :answer/id #uuid "0604da83-168d-5868-b7ce-e218590d7141" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-60" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109266/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "8611c250-fdce-5d6d-a70e-858665ef0758" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-109266/selection/f4ed4b34f4a5de49898377314514d2de061007c11b4d8d545eea74864f386ee8" :answer-field/choices ["q-109266/selection/ca566c3861ad95266b92d3d8e36c85c39daf1d1780cc1bf826ae0ac7accce583" "q-109266/selection/f4ed4b34f4a5de49898377314514d2de061007c11b4d8d545eea74864f386ee8" "q-109266/selection/a4c8bdda186d0d425e9963bf17967cd5e356d934f319fa58135b8f8cf8a589f8" "q-109266/selection/4fa830bda994f89067ddecaf273e4fa78aa4d8447b6388b70cafa0fc166e6f67" "q-109266/selection/ebfc0e0786b9e08f32fe2539ae50e791a60b7c4613bb2a0820cefbd3ea742454"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-109266" :question/id #uuid "7dc5732a-1ec2-518d-b117-eb2600bb1b85" :question/math-academy-id "q-109266" :question/problem "Find $\\,|\\begin{aligned}6 & 0 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & x & -1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 5 & y & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 5\\end{aligned}|$ given that $\\,|\\begin{aligned}x & -1 \\\\ 5 & y\\end{aligned}|=-3.$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that we have a block upper triangular matrix. Therefore, its determinant is equal to the product of the diagonal blocks' determinants:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\begin{aligned}6 & 0 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & x & -1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 5 & y & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 5\\end{aligned}| & =|\\begin{aligned}6 & 0 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & x & -1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 5 & y & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 5\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =6\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}x & -1 \\\\ 5 & y\\end{aligned}|\\cdot 5 \\\\  & =6\\cdot (-3)\\cdot 5 \\\\  & =-90.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-109266/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4b507561-8134-50ff-8c23-c4ecc546450d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-109266"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-42139/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "2d939bce-797b-5889-941c-6fa5855ccf72" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42139/selection/303632d9519e4b7e53f9af56aad03bb866b8b5ede58a0b8b2cb848d575460c53" :answer/id #uuid "0857d4ec-1352-5d8e-9706-75203aa174b9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42139/selection/10293ac0295e0e79554137a949f5c5c46b9812dcc0a3ecb6349c4cb5e6acdff3" :answer/id #uuid "989461ea-912d-55d3-8c99-96a3fca89167" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42139/selection/f509030681214332b5989836fe0af4b2eb5858d193e689fd8441dff5cd45ff45" :answer/id #uuid "bb9ce157-b0cc-548f-975b-24511d52638b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-12" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42139/selection/83c2285763389b0bc8b13e9777da06a48782d28e9c124603d3003cc4dc2e718a" :answer/id #uuid "9c06e78f-84da-5214-846e-01130c389277" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "14" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42139/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "37aa80e8-4562-5203-93a6-ef4fe567d966" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-42139/selection/83c2285763389b0bc8b13e9777da06a48782d28e9c124603d3003cc4dc2e718a" :answer-field/choices ["q-42139/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" "q-42139/selection/303632d9519e4b7e53f9af56aad03bb866b8b5ede58a0b8b2cb848d575460c53" "q-42139/selection/10293ac0295e0e79554137a949f5c5c46b9812dcc0a3ecb6349c4cb5e6acdff3" "q-42139/selection/f509030681214332b5989836fe0af4b2eb5858d193e689fd8441dff5cd45ff45" "q-42139/selection/83c2285763389b0bc8b13e9777da06a48782d28e9c124603d3003cc4dc2e718a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-42139" :question/id #uuid "afb41d0b-8aaf-5c91-bdb1-ffd640f7baf1" :question/math-academy-id "q-42139" :question/problem "Find \n$|\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & d & e \\\\ 0 & 2 & -1\\end{aligned}|$\ngiven that\n$|\\begin{aligned}d & e \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{aligned}|=7.$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that we have a block diagonal matrix. Therefore, its determinant is equal to the product of the diagonal blocks' determinants:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & d & e \\\\ 0 & 2 & -1\\end{aligned}| & =|\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & d & e \\\\ 0 & 2 & -1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}d & e \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2\\cdot 7 \\\\  & =14.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-42139/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4b507561-8134-50ff-8c23-c4ecc546450d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-42139"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "e-9093"] :question/problem "A partitioned matrix $M$ contains the following blocks: \n\n- $M_{11},$ which is a $1 \\times 2$ block\n\n- $M_{12},$ which is a $1 \\times 3$ block\n\n- $M_{21},$ which is a $2 \\times 2$ block\n\nFind the dimensions of the block $M_{22}$." :question/worked-solution "We have a matrix of the form\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041065/assets/2ebec2a87fd922bcbe30ee648e102188b48854abcad34d88cc18695cac67e1bd.png)\n\nTherefore,  $M_{22}$ must be a $2 \\times 3$ block." :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "e-9094"] :question/problem "Which of the following matrices are block diagonal?\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041065/assets/a610512000d95e3ed80559431e25501a9d498d342e7c180864720bbeb2ee10d4.png)" :question/worked-solution "A block diagonal matrix can be partitioned so that it has only square blocks on the main diagonal, and all the other blocks contain only zeros.\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine our matrices.\n\n- $A$ is a block diagonal matrix. Indeed, we can partition it as follows:\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041065/assets/f6e977aff21319bb8e0cbb251d36577966f84060e809e3485f9019e85cd3538e.png)\n\n- $B$ is *not* a block diagonal matrix since it can't be partitioned in the way described above:\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041065/assets/597e27b2f470bc60717eb3341d2f3e87f411c0a4c796a58ee3aa83c691971517.png)\n\n- $C$ is *not* a block diagonal matrix since it can't be partitioned in the way described above:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}C=[\\begin{aligned}5 & 0 & 8 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2\\end{aligned}],\\,C=[\\begin{aligned}5 & 0 & 8 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2\\end{aligned}],\\,C=[\\begin{aligned}5 & 0 & 8 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"$A$ only.\"" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "e-9096"] :question/problem "Find \n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041065/assets/f9f02df9d1e971ccea2d5abb67f95866bb334e636e5d39ec59d14a617d8f15f0.png)\ngiven that \n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041065/assets/58f57ca9a1782c7edc2367b2aed9798e8e2c1eb8318000e6202b3fa0746c6a90.png)" :question/worked-solution "Notice that we have  a block upper triangular matrix. Therefore, its determinant is equal to the product of the determinants of the diagonal blocks:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\begin{aligned}7 & 0 & -5 \\\\ 0 & e & 4 \\\\ 0 & h & 8\\end{aligned}| & =|\\begin{aligned}7 & 0 & -5 \\\\ 0 & e & 4 \\\\ 0 & h & 8\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =7\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}e & 4 \\\\ h & 8\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =7\\cdot 6 \\\\  & =42\\end{aligned}\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]}]
